text = "PREPARE AT INHABITED PORTS
Design in Ship Designer, save a blueprint, then select a Fleet slot and press + to construct. Stored materials are used first; credits buy shortages. Every hull needs one Command Center (the Tech/Civic checkerboard). Combat hulls also need a weapon.

TRAVEL AND RESEARCH
Open Map, inspect a reachable node, then choose Travel. Select a Research node, read its details, then Set Research Focus. Travel research: (labs + 0.5) x days. Enemy strength depends on the route, not your fleet.

LOSSES AND RECOVERY
Intact disconnected parts still work. Repair damage and reconstruct destroyed parts at ports. Passengers board on inhabited arrival; each death costs 20 credits and may cause debt. Disembark before reserving or replacing an occupied ship.

CONTROLS
Wheel: zoom. Drag / WASD: pan. Click a hull for its actions; reserved ships are managed through Reserve. Esc: close a dialog or clear canvas focus. Builder: 1–4 materials, M mirror, Ctrl+Z/Y undo/redo, Ctrl+S/L save/load. Battle: Space restores auto-camera."
autowrap_mode = 2
horizontal_alignment = 0
vertical_alignment = 0
